---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="DroidDeck 指南 — 故障排除与兼容性数据库"
  description="独立的 DroidDeck 故障排除与兼容性数据库。面向安卓掌机和骁龙手机的设备测试、错误修复、游戏兼容性清单、对比评测与版本更新说明。"
  page="home"
  locale="zh"
>
  <section class="game-hero" id="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="hero-intro">
        <div>
          <div class="hero-label"><span></span> 独立社区资源</div>
          <h1>DroidDeck 指南<span class="hero-subtitle">故障排除与兼容性数据库</span></h1>
          <p class="hero-slogan">能不能跑？<br>怎么修？<br>什么设置最流畅？</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-explain">
          <h2>来自社区，服务社区</h2>
          <p>我们在真机上测试 DroidDeck，收集错误修复方案，维护游戏兼容性清单，让你少花时间折腾，多花时间玩游戏。</p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a class="btn primary" href="/zh/compatibility-matrix/"><i class="ri-table-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 兼容性矩阵</a>
            <a class="btn dark-outline" href="/zh/devices/">浏览设备 <i class="ri-arrow-right-line" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
            <a class="btn dark-outline" href="/zh/troubleshooting/">修复问题 <i class="ri-arrow-right-line" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-notes">
            <span><i class="ri-check-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 设备实测报告</span>
            <span><i class="ri-check-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 错误 FAQ</span>
            <span><i class="ri-check-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 游戏兼容性</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <figure class="hero-screen">
        <div class="screen-caption">
          <span><i class="ri-gamepad-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 真机测试，清晰答案</span>
          <span>兼容性优先</span>
        </div>
        <img src="/assets/images/hero-screen.webp" alt="DroidDeck Steam 大屏幕模式游戏库" width="1440" height="667" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
      </figure>

      <div class="hero-bottom">
        <span>面向安卓掌机与骁龙手机的独立指南</span>
        <a href="#devices">探索数据库 <i class="ri-arrow-down-line" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="capability-bar">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a href="/zh/devices/"><i class="ri-smartphone-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 设备测试</a>
      <a href="/zh/troubleshooting/"><i class="ri-bug-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 错误修复</a>
      <a href="/zh/games/"><i class="ri-gamepad-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 游戏清单</a>
      <a href="/zh/compatibility-matrix/"><i class="ri-table-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 兼容性矩阵</a>
      <a href="/zh/updates/"><i class="ri-git-pull-request-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 版本说明</a>
      <a href="/zh/compare/"><i class="ri-scales-3-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 工具对比</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="feature-story wrap" id="devices">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <span class="kicker">设备兼容性</span>
        <h2>下载前先了解</h2>
      </div>
      <p>不是所有安卓设备都能流畅运行 DroidDeck。<br>我们的设备页面只回答一个核心问题：你的设备能不能用？</p>
    </div>
    <div class="story-grid">
      <div class="story-copy">
        <span class="section-number">01 / 设备实测报告</span>
        <h3>真机实测，<br>真实答案</h3>
        <p>每个设备页面都包含社区的真机测试结果：DroidDeck 能否启动、哪些游戏可玩、推荐分辨率与 FSR 设置、以及已知问题。</p>
        <p>我们聚焦用户真正关心的设备——安卓掌机和骁龙旗舰手机——并在新 DroidDeck 版本发布时更新数据。</p>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li>启动、稳定性与发热表现</li>
          <li>推荐分辨率与 FSR 预设</li>
          <li>手柄、键盘与触屏映射建议</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="text-link" href="/zh/devices/ayn-odin-2/">查看 Ayn Odin 2 报告 <i class="ri-arrow-right-line" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
      </div>
      <figure class="story-visual">
        <button class="zoom-button" aria-label="放大设备兼容性截图">
          <img src="/assets/images/game-management.webp" alt="DroidDeck 游戏管理界面" width="1280" height="614" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          <span class="zoom-hint"><i class="ri-fullscreen-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 查看大图</span>
        </button>
        <figcaption>DroidDeck 游戏管理</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <div class="device-grid">
      <article>
        <i class="ri-gamepad-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h3>Ayn Odin 2</h3>
        <p>骁龙 8 Gen 2 掌机，散热出色，是 DroidDeck 的可靠选择。</p>
        <a href="/zh/devices/ayn-odin-2/">阅读报告</a>
      </article>
      <article>
        <i class="ri-gamepad-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h3>Retroid Pocket 5</h3>
        <p>骁龙 865 掌机，玩大型游戏前请确认 GPU 兼容性。</p>
        <a href="/zh/devices/retroid-pocket-5/">阅读报告</a>
      </article>
      <article>
        <i class="ri-gamepad-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h3>Ayaneo Pocket S</h3>
        <p>骁龙 G3x Gen 2，做工精良，适合运行高负载游戏。</p>
        <a href="/zh/devices/ayaneo-pocket-s/">阅读报告</a>
      </article>
      <article>
        <i class="ri-cpu-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h3>骁龙 8 Gen 3 手机</h3>
        <p>搭载 Adreno 750 的最新旗舰手机，手机端最强性能。</p>
        <a href="/zh/devices/snapdragon-8-gen-3/">阅读报告</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="control-story" id="troubleshooting">
    <div class="wrap control-grid">
      <figure>
        <button class="zoom-button" aria-label="放大故障排除界面截图">
          <img src="/assets/images/controller-mapping.webp" alt="DroidDeck 触屏手柄编辑器" width="960" height="540" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          <span class="zoom-hint"><i class="ri-fullscreen-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 查看大图</span>
        </button>
        <figcaption>触屏手柄映射</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="control-copy">
        <span class="section-number">02 / 错误修复</span>
        <h2>卡住？从这里开始。</h2>
        <p>黑屏、启动崩溃、Steam 登录失败、存储空间不足、手柄无法识别、音频卡顿——我们把每个问题拆成症状、原因和分步修复方案。</p>
        <div class="control-options">
          <span><i class="ri-bug-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 黑屏</span>
          <span><i class="ri-bug-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 崩溃</span>
          <span><i class="ri-bug-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Steam 登录</span>
          <span><i class="ri-bug-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 无声音</span>
        </div>
        <a class="text-link" href="/zh/troubleshooting/black-screen/">修复黑屏 <i class="ri-arrow-right-line" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gallery-area wrap" id="games">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <span class="kicker">探索数据库</span>
        <h2>五种方式找到答案</h2>
      </div>
      <p>按设备、错误、游戏、对比或更新浏览。<br>每个版块都为搜索和快速查阅优化。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="gallery-layout">
      <div class="gallery-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="数据库版块">
        <button role="tab" id="tab-devices" aria-controls="panel-devices" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0">
          <span>01</span>
          <div><strong>设备</strong><small>测试报告与设置</small></div>
          <i class="ri-arrow-right-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </button>
        <button role="tab" id="tab-troubleshooting" aria-controls="panel-troubleshooting" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">
          <span>02</span>
          <div><strong>故障排除</strong><small>错误修复与 FAQ</small></div>
          <i class="ri-arrow-right-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </button>
        <button role="tab" id="tab-games" aria-controls="panel-games" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">
          <span>03</span>
          <div><strong>游戏</strong><small>兼容性清单</small></div>
          <i class="ri-arrow-right-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </button>
        <button role="tab" id="tab-compare" aria-controls="panel-compare" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">
          <span>04</span>
          <div><strong>对比</strong><small>DroidDeck 与其他工具</small></div>
          <i class="ri-arrow-right-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </button>
        <button role="tab" id="tab-updates" aria-controls="panel-updates" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">
          <span>05</span>
          <div><strong>更新</strong><small>更新日志与已知问题</small></div>
          <i class="ri-arrow-right-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="gallery-panels">
        <figure role="tabpanel" id="panel-devices" aria-labelledby="tab-devices">
          <button class="zoom-button" aria-label="放大设备版块">
            <img src="/assets/images/steam-library.webp" alt="Steam 大屏幕模式游戏库" width="1440" height="667" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <span class="zoom-hint"><i class="ri-fullscreen-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 查看大图</span>
          </button>
          <figcaption>设备页面列出真机测试结果与推荐设置。</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure role="tabpanel" id="panel-troubleshooting" aria-labelledby="tab-troubleshooting" hidden>
          <button class="zoom-button" aria-label="放大故障排除版块">
            <img src="/assets/images/game-management.webp" alt="DroidDeck 游戏管理" width="1280" height="614" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <span class="zoom-hint"><i class="ri-fullscreen-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 查看大图</span>
          </button>
          <figcaption>每个错误都有独立页面，包含症状、原因和修复方案。</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure role="tabpanel" id="panel-games" aria-labelledby="tab-games" hidden>
          <button class="zoom-button" aria-label="放大游戏版块">
            <img src="/assets/images/hero-screen.webp" alt="DroidDeck Steam 游戏库" width="1440" height="667" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <span class="zoom-hint"><i class="ri-fullscreen-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 查看大图</span>
          </button>
          <figcaption>游戏清单区分独立游戏 60 FPS 与高负载 3A 游戏。</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure role="tabpanel" id="panel-compare" aria-labelledby="tab-compare" hidden>
          <button class="zoom-button" aria-label="放大对比版块">
            <img src="/assets/images/controller-mapping.webp" alt="DroidDeck 手柄映射" width="960" height="540" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <span class="zoom-hint"><i class="ri-fullscreen-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 查看大图</span>
          </button>
          <figcaption>对比 DroidDeck、Winlator 与 Mobox，选择合适工具。</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure role="tabpanel" id="panel-updates" aria-labelledby="tab-updates" hidden>
          <button class="zoom-button" aria-label="放大更新版块">
            <img src="/assets/images/game-management-detail.webp" alt="DroidDeck 游戏管理详情" width="1280" height="614" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <span class="zoom-hint"><i class="ri-fullscreen-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 查看大图</span>
          </button>
          <figcaption>每个版本都有翻译后的更新说明与社区问题汇总。</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="getting-started" id="compare">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <span class="kicker">选择工具</span>
          <h2>DroidDeck 与替代方案对比</h2>
        </div>
        <a class="text-link" href="/zh/compare/">阅读完整对比 <i class="ri-arrow-right-line" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
      </div>
      <div class="compare-grid">
        <article>
          <h3>DroidDeck</h3>
          <p class="tag">Steam 优先 · ARM64 原生</p>
          <p>适合想要在安卓上获得 SteamOS 体验、原生 ARM64 Steam 客户端与集成手柄映射的用户。</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Winlator</h3>
          <p class="tag">Box 方案 · 兼容性广</p>
          <p>适合运行非 Steam 的 Windows 应用与游戏。设置更重，需要更多手动调优。</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>MoboX</h3>
          <p class="tag">Termux 方案 · PC 环境</p>
          <p>适合熟悉 Linux/Termux 工作流的用户。环境开销较大。</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="faq-area wrap" id="faq">
    <div class="faq-intro">
      <span class="kicker">常见问题</span>
      <h2>FAQ</h2>
      <p>关于本站、兼容性与如何贡献<br>的快速解答。</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/zh/troubleshooting/">浏览所有修复 <i class="ri-arrow-right-line" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details>
        <summary>这是 DroidDeck 官方网站吗？ <i class="ri-add-line" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary>
        <p>不是。DroidDeck 指南是独立社区资源。官方网站是 <a href="https://droiddeck.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">droiddeck.app</a>。我们专注故障排除与兼容性数据，不提供下载本身。</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>哪些设备可以运行 DroidDeck？ <i class="ri-add-line" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary>
        <p>DroidDeck 可在 Android 9+ 且 GPU 为 Adreno 730 或更新版本的设备上运行。骁龙 8 Gen 2/Gen 3 手机以及 Ayn Odin 2、Retroid Pocket 5、Ayaneo Pocket S 等安卓掌机是热门选择。Mali 与 Google Tensor GPU 未获官方支持。</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>需要 PC 或 root 吗？ <i class="ri-add-line" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary>
        <p>不需要 PC 串流，也不需要 root。DroidDeck 在安卓设备本地运行游戏。部分设备首次设置时需要一次性调整子进程上限。</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>兼容性数据是如何收集的？ <i class="ri-add-line" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary>
        <p>我们综合社区报告、Reddit/Discord 讨论以及我们自己的测试。每页都会标注 "已验证" 或 "社区报告"，让你了解可信度。</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>我可以提交测试结果吗？ <i class="ri-add-line" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary>
        <p>可以。使用页脚的提交报告链接或加入 Discord。请包含设备型号、DroidDeck 版本、游戏、设置与结果。</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>数据库多久更新一次？ <i class="ri-add-line" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary>
        <p>我们目标是在每个新 DroidDeck 版本发布后 48 小时内发布翻译更新说明和问题汇总。设备与游戏页面每季度或出现重大 bug 时 review。</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="download-area" id="updates">
    <div class="wrap download-inner">
      <div>
        <span class="download-kicker">保持关注</span>
        <h2>获取最新兼容性说明。</h2>
        <p>新的 DroidDeck 版本可能改变兼容性。我们翻译更新日志并汇总新 bug，让你在更新前心中有数。</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn primary" href="/zh/updates/"><i class="ri-git-pull-request-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> 最新更新</a>
          <a class="btn dark-outline" href="https://droiddeck.app/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">官方下载 <i class="ri-arrow-right-line" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="download-qr">
        <div class="qr-placeholder"><i class="ri-qr-code-line" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
        <figcaption>扫码获取官方下载</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@graph": [
      {
        "@type": "WebSite",
        "name": "DroidDeck 指南",
        "url": "https://droiddeck-guide.gg/zh/",
        "description": "独立的 DroidDeck 故障排除与兼容性数据库。"
      },
      {
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "mainEntity": [
          {"@type":"Question","name":"这是 DroidDeck 官方网站吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"不是。DroidDeck 指南是独立社区资源。官方网站是 droiddeck.app。"}},
          {"@type":"Question","name":"哪些设备可以运行 DroidDeck？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"DroidDeck 可在 Android 9+ 且 Adreno 730 或更新 GPU 的设备上运行。骁龙 8 Gen 2/Gen 3 手机和安卓掌机是热门选择。"}},
          {"@type":"Question","name":"需要 PC 或 root 吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"不需要。DroidDeck 在安卓设备本地运行游戏，无需 root。"}}
        ]
      }
    ]
  })} />
</Layout>
